  "description": "Experience metapackage bundling Excalibur.Dispatch with PostgreSQL event sourcing. Provides a single AddDispatchWithPostgres() call for the common PostgreSQL scenario. No outbox is registered: the PostgreSQL outbox store is built from an application-supplied Excalibur.Data.IDb, which a connection string alone cannot construct. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
